<title>FRANCE: Saint-Gobain Q1 sales up 31.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Saint-Gobain Q1 sales up 31.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					24,458    vs   18,652</p>
<p>NOTE - Saint-Gobain said in a statement that at a constant structure basis, sales would have been up 5.9 percent in French francs and 1.4 percent in local currencies.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
